WEBVTT

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:14.440
There is a song that will destroy the world!

00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:32.840
Mom...

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:35.040
Remember that

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:37.720
your hands are stained with blood.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:42.250
How can you imagine that such 
hands can save the world?

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:45.230
Even so, I...

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:46.280
Yes.

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:49.480
The reason you wish to save the world

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:51.970
is that you, yourself, desire to be saved.

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:55.430
Maria, that isn't Mom!

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:59.280
We know where Mom is sleeping now.

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:00.740
This must be the fortress's...

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:02.680
I know that!

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:04.610
That isn't really Mom,

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:07.750
but what she said is true!

00:01:08.430 --> 00:01:10.560
You want to be saved, don't you?

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:13.760
From that silver flash that's 
far too bright for you?

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:21.590
Kiri-chan! Maria! Let's fall back!

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:23.160
What's going on?

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:24.210
I don't know!

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:26.520
But right now, this is all we can do.

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:30.020
This really, really feels like a trap!

00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:51.300
The world's disintegration continues!

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:53.300
It's about to reach the city.

00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:58.700
This is the last stage of the plan...

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:04.160
You're hurt badly!

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:07.940
Stopping Carol is my job.

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:10.620
I have to watch this to the end.

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:19.450
Why is an alchemist fighting?

00:02:20.320 --> 00:02:23.380
Seven planets and seven musical scales.

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:26.660
The harmony of the universe, 
alchemy's deepest secret,

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:28.500
is the harmony of music

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:31.500
and the absolute truth it creates.

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:33.000
What do you mean?

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:35.830
As they all come from the same source,

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:38.170
there's nothing strange about it at all.

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:43.920
In the prehistoric era, after the Curse of Balal

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:46.990
removed humanity's mutual understanding,

00:02:46.990 --> 00:02:50.190
they sought a new method.

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:53.090
Alchemy is communication with the world,

00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:56.280
attaining harmony with it by knowing all.

00:02:56.520 --> 00:03:00.670
They tried to use it to go beyond words, 
to connect with the world.

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:01.780
Songs...

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:03.990
Both alchemy and songs

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:08.320
were created to restore the lost unified language.

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:09.980
Impossible.

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:13.070
Its origin is lost to history,

00:03:13.070 --> 00:03:16.170
but you three should easily be able to guess.

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:22.860
If it's a trap, now would be 
the time to spring it, but...

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:26.080
A trap worse than a trap.

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:29.520
Could it be that the one leading us here was...

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:31.620
...Dr. Ver.

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:34.170
You can see the state I'm in.

00:03:34.570 --> 00:03:40.800
I didn't have enough blood left to easily take 
control of the Château's full functionality.

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:44.530
Now, make a trade with me on the battlefield!

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:52.610
The control system of the Château de Tiffauges.

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:54.920
In other words, if we destroy this...

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:58.810
How many generations behind 
is the processor in your head?

00:03:58.810 --> 00:04:02.090
All that will do is send it out of control.

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:03.590
Then what do we do?

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:12.510
While you stand there panicking,

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:15.350
the world is disintegrating around you.

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:17.480
Don't forget that!

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:22.740
Songs...

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:25.490
Songs are destroying the world?

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:27.800
The center of Tokyo is

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:30.670
the end point of the ley lines.

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:34.000
Which also means that I can use this place

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:37.500
to send songs around the entire world.

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:41.380
That's why you destroyed the keystones, 
which were safety valves!

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:43.770
Is there nothing we can do?

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:46.740
There is!

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:50.060
Even if ten thousand plans fail,

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:52.310
there must be ten thousand and one.

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:54.060
I'm sure of that!

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:58.000
Maria-san...

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:07.780
Finish them...

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:09.660
...while we hold them off.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:13.290
I told you I can't handle this because 
I don't have enough blood!

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:15.580
Kids are always so selfish.

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:19.570
You're still alive, Dr. Ver?

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:21.000
What are you doing?

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:24.730
Rewriting the Château's program...

00:05:24.730 --> 00:05:28.140
At its core, alchemy is dismantling and analyzing.

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:29.740
And...

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.460
You're going to invert

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:35.770
its functionality and restore the world?

00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:37.080
Impossible.

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:40.620
The Château won't be able to endure that!

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:42.610
It'll absorb all of you!

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:45.110
Yeah, and explode.

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:49.690
Either way, I can stop the disintegration.

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:54.040
It's so much fun to screw with someone's plans!

00:05:58.010 --> 00:05:59.350
Dr. Ver...

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:06.550
Mom.

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:13.390
The disintegration of the world won't stop.

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:15.970
I won't let it.

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:17.480
We'll stop it...

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:19.020
With Elfnein-chan's help!

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:19.940
Don't do it.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:24.070
Using the Ignite Module might help Carol!

00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:34.420
I'll ram you with

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:36.540
a huge finisher!

00:06:39.470 --> 00:06:41.380
You aren't Mom!

00:06:56.730 --> 00:06:58.160
I am Finé.

00:06:58.470 --> 00:07:01.440
Yes, the one who bears the name of the end.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.120
I see...

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:06.090
You're me.

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:10.450
You're what happened to us 
after we continued in error.

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:14.450
But dark histories exist to be rewritten!

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:17.130
Before the Château explodes,

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:19.960
let's overcome our sin and try to escape!

00:07:38.860 --> 00:07:40.020
Maria-san,

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:43.070
can you give the communicator to Dr. Ver?

00:07:43.070 --> 00:07:44.020
What?

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:46.270
I'll fight in my own way.

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:47.520
Doctor!

00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:52.110
Connect this terminal to the Château.

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:53.300
I'll help you.

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:54.660
How exciting.

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:56.530
But can you do it?

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:00.160
I see... We'll use the photosphere.

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:03.120
If we use the model data of the 
ley lines for the processing,

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:04.040
we can do it from here!

00:08:04.360 --> 00:08:05.110
Fujitaka!

00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:09.880
I wouldn't want Carol to be the only one 
to use what Dr. Nastassja left behind.

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:11.840
I'll get her back!

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:15.320
We'll handle the processing here, 
to reduce your load.

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:19.600
Please use all the Château's functionality 
you can control for the reconstruction.

00:08:36.180 --> 00:08:39.090
<i>I'll bring an end to the sins I committed!</i>

00:08:39.090 --> 00:08:40.550
Shirabe, Kirika!

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:43.160
Leave this to me and go help the others!

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:49.460
The three of us...

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:51.960
...have to overcome our sins together!

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:56.470
Thank you, both of you...

00:08:57.080 --> 00:09:00.830
Doctor, we shall protect you, 
even at the cost of our lives.

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:03.300
So you save the world!

00:09:10.380 --> 00:09:11.360
Stop...

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:14.360
Stop getting in my way!

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:16.220
Stop!

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:24.920
Standing on stage with you, 
Tsubasa, was so much fun...

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:27.170
If we can do it again,

00:09:27.720 --> 00:09:30.310
I want to sing all night.

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:32.350
Maria, what are you...

00:09:33.150 --> 00:09:37.800
I always thought it was amazing how you 
befriended those you fought, Chris-san.

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:39.880
I looked up to you.

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:42.470
You can do it, too... You already have!

00:09:42.730 --> 00:09:43.910
I'm sorry.

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:47.100
I called you a hypocrite, even though 
I didn't know anything.

00:09:47.460 --> 00:09:50.230
I know I should apologize in person, but...

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:52.520
I don't care! Just—

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:58.160
Please don't...

00:09:58.160 --> 00:10:00.530
Don't get in Papa's and my way!

00:10:01.670 --> 00:10:05.400
I'll protect the world with my alchemy.

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:07.540
I won't let Carol destroy it!

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:27.390
Serena!

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:34.910
Don't do it!

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:19.360
The disintegrated areas are being restored.

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:23.610
But Maria-san and the others...

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:29.470
Can we not bring forth tomorrow 
without paying a price?

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:47.310
The Château... The task I was given...

00:11:51.090 --> 00:11:52.310
Everyone...

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:54.310
Why? Damn it all!

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:00.990
Surrender!

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:02.930
The future you dreamed of

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:05.370
has turned to rubble and collapsed!

00:12:06.970 --> 00:12:07.910
Future?

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:10.620
Stop this...

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:12.910
Please, Carol.

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:17.420
This isn't what our papa wouwanted.

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:26.380
When he told us to learn about the world, 
while being burned at the stake,

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:29.720
this isn't what he wanted us to do.

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:31.470
I know that!

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:35.730
But then how am I supposed to avenge Papa?

00:12:36.110 --> 00:12:40.410
What about how sad we were 
when he was killed?!

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:43.510
He just gave us the problem,

00:12:43.510 --> 00:12:46.700
and never told us the answer!

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:49.330
That's...

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:52.760
Your father wanted

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:55.750
to tell you something important, didn't he?

00:12:57.740 --> 00:13:00.010
I think that when your life is about to end,

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:03.520
you say the thing you want most to say.

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:08.140
What our papa, an alchemist,

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:11.010
wanted to tell us more than anything...

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:16.310
Then it can't be anything but the truth.

00:13:17.010 --> 00:13:19.690
Alchemy's final goal

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:22.880
is to communicate and be in harmony

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:25.990
with the world, by knowing all things...

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:28.830
Harmony?

00:13:29.230 --> 00:13:32.600
You want me to accept the 
world that rejected Papa?

00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:33.870
He didn't say that!

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:36.040
He'd never say that!

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:40.290
Then I'll answer for him.

00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:47.800
Forgiveness is the problem's answer.

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:52.410
He told us to forgive the world

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:55.810
for what it did to him.

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:02.980
Hey!

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:09.320
The Château de Tiffauges is destroyed,

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:13.970
and the future where the Apocalypse 
of All Things is complete is gone.

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:22.540
Then I shall abandon the past, 
and destroy the present!

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:29.210
No!

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:33.390
If you do that, you'll burn up all 
the memories you have of Papa!

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:36.240
She's trying to burn all her memories,

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:39.020
to turn them into combat power?

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:44.020
What are you doing, Carol-chan?

00:14:44.380 --> 00:14:46.130
Revenge!

00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:57.010
Revenge is all I have left...

00:14:57.730 --> 00:14:59.530
The flames of her revenge

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:02.960
won't burn out until her memories are gone?

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:09.090
Elfnein doesn't want revenge...

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:10.540
Yeah.

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:13.720
Elfnein-chan wants...

00:15:14.200 --> 00:15:16.430
Ignite? Are you serious?

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:20.340
Hibiki-san!

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:23.650
The odds are pretty skewed against that bet.

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:25.310
But I don't mind.

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:27.920
Especially now...

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:33.460
Elfnein-chan gave us this power.

00:15:33.880 --> 00:15:35.830
So I won't doubt it!

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:37.800
<i>Ignite Module!</i>

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:39.330
<i>Double Drawn Blade!</i>

00:15:41.810 --> 00:15:43.290
Dáinn. Dáinsleif.

00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:24.900
Two of the Ignite Module's three safeties

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:26.460
have been disabled in a row!

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:29.460
It's moved from Phase Nigredo to Albedo!

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:34.340
The risk increases as the output does.

00:16:38.990 --> 00:16:40.570
Raw power...

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:43.600
Just like you. And very cute.

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:45.350
But...

00:16:48.340 --> 00:16:50.610
We activated two of Ignite Module's stages!

00:16:51.930 --> 00:16:54.280
Now it's my turn to sing.

00:17:05.030 --> 00:17:06.500
Her output's gone up again?

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:09.460
Just how much phonic gain does she have?

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:12.590
But this is what I've been waiting for!

00:17:13.980 --> 00:17:15.170
<i>Drawn Blade!</i>

00:17:15.170 --> 00:17:18.330
<i>All safeties, release!</i>

00:17:19.060 --> 00:17:20.580
Dáinsleif.

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:27.850
It's shifted to Rubedo, the final phase!

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:38.990
We'll overpower her with the 
Ignite Module's output!

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:42.740
And bring together this storm of 
phonic gain, then release it!

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:46.620
<i>S2CA Tri-burst!</i>

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:52.500
It's going off on its own!

00:17:52.920 --> 00:17:55.900
I know the Ignite Module's maximum output.

00:17:56.440 --> 00:18:00.010
Didn't you know that's why I threw it away?

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:04.530
My songs have the power of

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:09.450
seven billion Climax Songs' phonic gain!

00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:15.900
Too easy.

00:18:25.990 --> 00:18:28.750
Even if ten thousand plans fail,

00:18:29.300 --> 00:18:32.420
there have to be ten thousand and one...

00:18:32.720 --> 00:18:41.360
<i>Gatrandis Babel ziggurat Edenal.</i>

00:18:41.360 --> 00:18:49.010
<i>Emustolronzen Finé el Balal zizzl.</i>

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:47.640
Maria-san...

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:54.640
Dr. Ver!

00:18:55.160 --> 00:18:58.440
I saved everything...

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:00.150
You can't...

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:02.800
I saved you

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:07.580
so you could tell the world about my heroic deed...

00:19:09.910 --> 00:19:12.090
Now, go.

00:19:12.390 --> 00:19:15.630
And show the world you shamed 
yourself by surviving!

00:19:16.320 --> 00:19:18.410
Or are you still

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:22.410
a failure of a woman like you once were?

00:19:27.340 --> 00:19:28.930
It's love.

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:30.940
Why are you talking about love now?

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:35.940
Miracles have nothing to do with 
Symphogear compatibility.

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:39.950
If you want to make that power your own,

00:19:39.950 --> 00:19:42.700
reach out your hand...

00:19:54.180 --> 00:19:55.510
Maria,

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:59.090
was I able to be a hero?

00:19:59.570 --> 00:20:00.380
Yes.

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:02.840
The worst.

00:20:05.090 --> 00:20:13.900
<i>Gatrandis Babel ziggurat Edenal.</i>

00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:23.660
<i>Emustolronzen Finé el zizzl.</i>

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:19.800
Don't think you can stop me!

00:20:30.990 --> 00:20:34.000
<i>S2CA Hexa-Conversion!</i>

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:37.970
I'll use Gungnir to bring the phonic gain together!

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:41.380
And Airgetlám to control and redistribute it!

00:20:57.960 --> 00:21:00.270
One final miracle...

00:21:00.630 --> 00:21:01.610
No way.

00:21:01.970 --> 00:21:04.820
They're using the phonic gain I unleashed?

00:21:10.430 --> 00:21:12.250
<i>Generator...</i>

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:17.220
<i>...EX-Drive!</i>

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:24.010
No... It can't be.

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:02.190
This is...

00:22:03.210 --> 00:22:05.290
...the shape of a miracle.
